Hello all,

The Team have just sent a snap-shot of expl3 plus the xbase part of the
xpackages to CTAN.  As detailed in the release text, we hope to
establish a semi-regular process of sending snap-shots to CTAN,
including a TDS-ready ZIP. This should help more people to use the
ongoing LaTeX3 code without needing to grab it from the SVN. We also
expect that this will mean that both MiKTeX and TeX Live 2009 will be
able to offer updates for these packages to the wider LaTeX community.
--
Joseph Wright

